Package: softglowos-store
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Kevin Schmidt <https://github.com/kevinschmidt777/softglowos>
Homepage: https://softglowos.com
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: softglowos-base, flatpak, gnome-software, gnome-software-plugin-deb, @SHLIBS@
Description: Softglow Store, the app store of SoftglowOS
 Bazaar by kolunmi and contributors (GPL-3.0), built as Softglow Store: apps
 from Flathub, with SoftglowOS's home page and without the Flatpaks of the
 apps SoftglowOS ships itself. GNOME Software stays hidden and only opens
 downloaded .deb files.
